title: "Global dredging footprint pipeline"
abstract: >
  AIS-based estimation of global seafloor swept-area ratio (SAR) and
  cumulative risk index (CRI) for trailing-suction hopper dredgers,
  with OCIM2-48L ocean transport model for CO2 perturbation quantification.
